    SiteExample('nursery', 'Gandun shuke-shuke', 'Lambuna uku na m 12 × 48 ƙarƙashin ƙananan masu fesa ruwa na sama a grid na m 4 × 4, yanki ɗaya ga kowane lambu, tanki mai tsayi, ƙaramin famfo da tace mai faifai.'),
